render(){
  const ctx=this.ctx;
  const dpr=this.dpr, s=this.scale;
  // camera current
  const cam=this.camera;
  ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);
  this.drawBackground(cam);
  // shake
  let shakeX=0, shakeY=0;
  if (this.shake>0.1){ const a=this.shake; shakeX=(Math.random()*2-1)*a; shakeY=...;}
  ctx.setTransform(dpr*s,0,0,dpr*s, (-cam.x+shakeX)*dpr*s, (-cam.y+shakeY)*dpr*s);
  this.drawWorld(cam);
  ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);
  this.drawOverlays();
}
```
Note dpr*scale maps world units to device px, and CSS coords transform is dpr. Translation in device px correct.

